# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Editorial source for /guides/<slug>/ — one independent guide per free tool.

Every entry carries its own facts, rules, regional notes, mistakes and FAQs.
Nothing here is generated by reusing the tool card copy: a guide that merely
restates its tool page would compete with it instead of earning new queries.

Keys used by the renderer:
  group    one of edit / invites / numbers / words / docs
  title    <= 60 chars, meta_description <= 155 chars (gate-enforced)
  facts    (label, value) pairs rendered as a quick-reference table
  s1/s2/s3 three body paragraphs (how it works / regional notes / mistakes)
  faq      three (question, answer) pairs, mirrored into FAQPage JSON-LD
  rel      two related tool slugs for the cluster's internal links
"""

G = {}

